# Admin dashboard domain

- Doc: `docs/modules/admin-dashboard.md`
- Agent: `/tableflow-admin-dashboard`
- Own: `/admin` routes, guard, metrics/company context, overview/activity/sala/staff/settings
- Keep KPIs tenant-scoped; never fake zeros on query failure
- Personal/create-user → `/tableflow-users`; operative `/sala` → `/tableflow-workspace`; checklist → `/tableflow-onboarding`
- No schema/RLS/Edge or onboarding-flow changes without authorization
- Tests: `admin-metrics.service.spec.ts`, `admin-dashboard.guard.spec.ts`
